  "description": "Ethernia, a divine empire that forbids women's desires. Michaela, a ducal daughter and the empire's most eligible bride, confesses a secret at the temple that must never be heard by anyone. \n\n\"Impiously, every night... I defile myself with my own hands...\" \n\nUpon hearing this confession, Priest Luca seizes upon her weakness and proposes a 'purification ritual' to wash away her sin... \n\n\"I will cleanly wash away everything about you.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/secret_prayer_lady)",
